	<element name="Timeless Body" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_DRUID_TIMELESS_BODY">
		<description><p>The primal magic that you wield causes you to age more slowly: for every 10 years that pass, your body ages only 1 year.</p></description>
	</element>

	<element name="Beast Spells" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_DRUID_BEAST_SPELLS">
		<description><p>You can cast many of your druid spells in any shape you assume using Wild Shape, performing the somatic and verbal components of a spell while in beast shape.</p></description>
	</element>

